 "summary": "Eight NPN general-purpose transistors in the three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount package, rated for 0.1 A of collector current and 200 mW of dissipation. BC846 withstands 65 V collector to emitter, BC847 45 V and BC848 30 V. The last letter sorts DC current gain at 2 mA into rank A (110 to 220), B (200 to 450) or C (420 to 800); BC846 comes in ranks A and B only. BC846B is the 65 V part of rank B. The PNP complements are BC856 to BC858.",
