   "topic": "Gain ranks and marking",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Each part carries a two-character code on top of the body: 1A and 1B for BC846A and BC846B; 1E, 1F and 1G for BC847A, B and C; 1J, 1K and 1L for BC848A, B and C. The letter suffix is the hFE rank: A 110 to 220, B 200 to 450, C 420 to 800."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Complements",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "BC856, BC857 and BC858 are the matching PNP types."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Package and assembly",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Moisture sensitivity level 1 to J-STD-020, with a lead-free reflow peak of 260 °C. The mold compound is rated UL 94V-0, RoHS compliant and halogen-free. Leads are solder plated and meet MIL-STD-750 method 2026 for solderability."
  }
